This project is a PyTorch reimplementation of, and in places a direct port of,
slippi-ai (https://github.com/vladfi1/slippi-ai), which is likewise MIT
licensed:

    Copyright (c) 2020 Vlad Firoiu

It interfaces with libmelee (https://github.com/altf4/libmelee), which is
licensed under the LGPL v3. libmelee is used as an unmodified library
dependency and is not distributed as part of this project.
